WEBVTT

01:32.030 --> 01:34.360
<b>Why do I have to die?</b>

01:34.740 --> 01:36.820
<b>Because you sold me out.</b>

01:37.530 --> 01:40.540
<b>I have a reason to keep living.</b>

01:41.500 --> 01:44.920
<b>So that guys like us no longer...</b>

01:45.170 --> 01:47.550
<b>So that these bastards
stop robbing children</b>

01:47.550 --> 01:50.320
<b>of their parents and
turning them into weapons!</b>

01:50.320 --> 01:52.550
<b>I gave up everything for that to happen!</b>

01:53.090 --> 01:55.010
<b>Even you, my close friend!</b>

01:55.010 --> 01:56.390
<b>Why do this, Sigma?</b>

01:56.970 --> 02:00.100
<b>Someone like you with no righteousness
or will of your own...</b>

02:00.330 --> 02:02.560
<b>What reason will you
live for after killing me?</b>

02:03.100 --> 02:05.850
<b>I need... a reason?</b>

02:06.190 --> 02:07.060
<b>What?</b>

02:07.900 --> 02:10.070
<b>For some reason, I don't want to die.</b>

02:10.900 --> 02:13.110
<b>I don't particularly like pain, either.</b>

02:13.490 --> 02:15.530
<b>That's why.</b>

02:15.760 --> 02:17.240
<b>What the...</b>

02:21.950 --> 02:25.210
<b>So, you had thought of me
as a close friend.</b>

02:27.580 --> 02:29.340
<b>I can't laugh at that joke.</b>

02:33.670 --> 02:35.050
<b>Sorry to make you wait.</b>

02:35.970 --> 02:38.760
<b>You said you wanted to ask me something?</b>

02:39.430 --> 02:42.970
<b>I know who you are, Mr. Yuukaku Kuruoka.</b>

02:43.680 --> 02:45.770
<b>My boss is Francesca...</b>

02:46.190 --> 02:48.690
<b>and Mr. Faldeus is among my clients.</b>

02:49.110 --> 02:50.310
<b>Ah...</b>

02:50.310 --> 02:53.530
<b>I had thought you were a spellcaster,
and sure enough...</b>

02:54.240 --> 02:56.900
<b>Can you tell me what is going on?</b>

02:57.910 --> 02:59.990
<b>What exactly is this world?</b>

03:00.740 --> 03:02.290
<b>In my opinion,</b>

03:02.290 --> 03:06.910
<b>this is a Reality Marble intentionally
created by Tsubaki's Servant.</b>

03:07.670 --> 03:10.510
<b>That thing is a concept like death,</b>

03:10.510 --> 03:15.590
<b>a void, or illness that has been
purposely given a personality.</b>

03:15.970 --> 03:20.640
<b>A type of folk Magecraft that captures
phenomena into a shape with a will.</b>

03:20.640 --> 03:26.390
<b>In that Servant's case, I'm sure it is
an existence that's recognized globally.</b>

03:26.620 --> 03:29.650
<b>You don't want to try getting out of here?</b>

03:30.150 --> 03:31.360
<b>Why would I?</b>

03:31.360 --> 03:34.110
<b>Tsubaki is healthy and well here.</b>

03:34.820 --> 03:38.490
<b>Perhaps your mind is dominated,
so you think that way?</b>

03:38.490 --> 03:39.160
<b>Yes.</b>

03:39.610 --> 03:41.320
<b>I believe that is the case.</b>

03:41.320 --> 03:44.910
<b>However, what of that is a problem?</b>

03:47.710 --> 03:48.460
<b>Who is it?</b>

03:49.000 --> 03:50.500
<b>Where are you?</b>

03:50.500 --> 03:52.750
<b>Try looking around, little girl.</b>

03:52.750 --> 03:54.550
<b>It's hide-and-go-seek.</b>

03:54.550 --> 03:59.470
<b>If you can find me, I'll give you
some sweet, sweet candy syrup.</b>

04:01.140 --> 04:03.600
<b>Then, do you understand that your daughter</b>

04:03.600 --> 04:06.390
<b>is being targeted outside
of the Reality Marble?</b>

04:06.970 --> 04:09.270
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

04:09.270 --> 04:10.770
<b>That is quite an ordeal.</b>

04:11.480 --> 04:15.820
<b>However, Tsubaki's Servant
is starting to become quite solid.</b>

04:16.150 --> 04:17.240
<b>Solid?</b>

04:17.610 --> 04:20.320
<b>A short while before you came to...</b>

04:20.320 --> 04:24.200
<b>it sent us a wonderful guard dog.</b>

04:25.660 --> 04:28.080
<b>Looks like your conversation
was overheard.</b>

04:35.420 --> 04:37.130
<b>I will follow that thing.</b>

04:37.460 --> 04:39.030
<b>The fact that it's on the move</b>

04:39.030 --> 04:42.050
<b>means that it may have
an ally where it is headed to.</b>

04:42.050 --> 04:43.220
<b>Got it.</b>

04:43.220 --> 04:44.680
<b>I'll stay...</b>

04:45.050 --> 04:46.970
<b>and do what I can do.</b>

04:46.970 --> 04:48.310
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

04:52.310 --> 04:52.940
<b>Switch!</b>

05:25.180 --> 05:26.100
<b><i>Ex...</i></b>

05:26.100 --> 05:28.060
<b><i>calibur!</i></b>

05:33.190 --> 05:34.190
<b>Saber!</b>

05:34.190 --> 05:35.350
<b>Are you all right, Ayaka?</b>

05:37.270 --> 05:38.190
<b>That's mine!</b>

05:38.190 --> 05:40.070
<b>Sorry, I borrowed it!</b>

05:40.070 --> 05:43.650
<b>This is an emergency situation,
so I'd be delighted if you let this slide!</b>

05:43.650 --> 05:45.700
<b>Next time, I'll arrest you for robbery.</b>

05:46.530 --> 05:48.530
<b>That's quite scary!</b>

05:51.910 --> 05:54.460
<b>O guard dog,
the sentry of the bottomless pit!</b>

05:55.080 --> 05:56.380
<b>If you have intelligence, listen up!</b>

05:57.460 --> 05:59.590
<b>It is good if you deemed that I,</b>

05:59.590 --> 06:01.970
<b>a Heroic Spirit, was
a soul avoiding death!</b>

06:02.550 --> 06:06.890
<b>However, these ones here
are most definitely still alive!</b>

06:07.260 --> 06:11.020
<b>If you are a disciple swearing allegiance
to the king of the underworld,</b>

06:11.020 --> 06:14.850
<b>I wish for you to righteously carry out
that allegiance! What say you?</b>

06:18.480 --> 06:19.520
<b>Can it be...</b>

06:19.520 --> 06:21.530
<b>that it understands language?</b>

06:35.670 --> 06:36.540
<b>This is...</b>

06:42.920 --> 06:44.220
<b>The living.</b>

06:45.260 --> 06:46.680
<b>The living.</b>

06:47.050 --> 06:49.390
<b>Those who used to be...</b>

06:49.390 --> 06:51.010
<b>the living.</b>

06:51.010 --> 06:51.970
<b>A declaration.</b>

06:52.890 --> 06:54.310
<b>Your bodies...</b>

06:54.930 --> 06:56.640
<b>have no life in them.</b>

07:00.310 --> 07:01.320
<b>This is...</b>

07:02.400 --> 07:03.990
<b><i>Sink into caging darkness...</i></b>

07:04.280 --> 07:05.700
<b><i>Zabaniya.</i></b>

07:12.620 --> 07:13.790
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

07:13.790 --> 07:16.460
<b><i>That is likely the underworld.</i></b>

07:16.460 --> 07:19.040
<b>H-Hold on a sec, Professor!</b>

07:19.040 --> 07:22.170
<b>Does that mean we are already dead?</b>

07:22.500 --> 07:23.920
<b><i>That's not so.</i></b>

07:23.920 --> 07:28.130
<b><i>What I called "the underworld"
is the characteristic within that field.</i></b>

07:28.890 --> 07:33.010
<b>Like how what is seen in a mirror
corresponds to reality...</b>

07:33.010 --> 07:35.960
<b>Cerberus being activated makes me think</b>

07:35.960 --> 07:39.350
<b>the location has an
aspect of the underworld.</b>

07:40.060 --> 07:41.490
<b><i>In regard to Magecraft,</i></b>

07:41.490 --> 07:44.190
<b><i>dreams are often
perceived as the afterlife.</i></b>

07:45.030 --> 07:50.070
<b><i>Tsubaki Kuruoka's Servant uses
her comatose dreams as the catalyst...</i></b>

07:50.070 --> 07:52.830
<b><i>to create an artificial underworld.</i></b>

07:53.280 --> 07:58.160
<b>In other words, this is a dream world
that reflects upon the existing city?</b>

07:58.160 --> 08:03.630
<b><i>The Servant who created that space
is quite a systematic being.</i></b>

08:03.860 --> 08:06.010
<b><i>Something close to the underworld.</i></b>

08:06.010 --> 08:10.240
<b><i>Likely something close
to the concept of death itself.</i></b>

08:10.240 --> 08:12.760
<b>Its consciousness is continuing to learn</b>

08:12.760 --> 08:15.560
<b>by dealing with the
reactions of its Master...</b>

08:15.560 --> 08:17.060
<b>Tsubaki Kuruoka.</b>

08:18.270 --> 08:21.270
<b>Brainwashing the residents of Snowfield
may be a result...</b>

08:21.270 --> 08:24.320
<b>of making the girl's wishes come true.</b>

08:24.730 --> 08:26.110
<b>But Professor...</b>

08:26.110 --> 08:28.530
<b>we got taken into this world...</b>

08:28.530 --> 08:30.450
<b>but we don't seem
to be brainwashed.</b>

08:31.030 --> 08:32.300
<b><i>About that,</i></b>

08:32.300 --> 08:36.080
<b><i>I can narrow down my speculations from
the perspective of why that didn't happen.</i></b>

08:36.310 --> 08:39.460
<b>"Whydunit"! Right?
Like your signature phrase!</b>

08:39.910 --> 08:42.670
<b>Oh, you almost sound like a detective.</b>

08:44.590 --> 08:46.060
<b>It's not out in the open,</b>

08:46.060 --> 08:49.630
<b>but you all are considered
missing persons in the real world.</b>

08:50.220 --> 08:54.350
<b><i>It is likely you were drawn
into the barrier, physical body and all,</i></b>

08:54.350 --> 08:56.350
<b><i>and that's why you were not brainwashed.</i></b>

08:57.060 --> 09:00.350
<b><i>As to how that location can link up
to the outside world like this...</i></b>

09:00.350 --> 09:02.810
<b><i>it is because something compatible
within that world...</i></b>

09:02.810 --> 09:06.480
<b><i>exists in the same location
in the real world.</i></b>

09:06.940 --> 09:09.690
<b><i>The most conceivable prospect
would be a corpse...</i></b>

09:09.690 --> 09:14.700
<b><i>and not just any corpse,
but one under some effect of Magecraft.</i></b>

09:15.700 --> 09:16.370
<b>Sir!</b>

09:16.700 --> 09:18.620
<b>Something is climbing up from underneath!</b>

09:23.120 --> 09:25.330
<b><i>What's wrong, Flat? What happened?</i></b>

09:25.710 --> 09:27.000
<b>A woman!</b>

09:27.000 --> 09:29.050
<b>She's likely a Servant!</b>

09:29.420 --> 09:31.380
<b>You were over here, as well?</b>

09:32.260 --> 09:34.090
<b>A foreign priest?</b>

09:34.470 --> 09:38.350
<b>Whoa, there.
Today, I am acting as the Overseer.</b>

09:38.350 --> 09:39.460
<b>By the way,</b>

09:39.460 --> 09:42.770
<b>I'll let you know they have no
intention of engaging in warfare, either.</b>

09:43.350 --> 09:47.860
<b>At least, not until we escape
from this Reality Marble.</b>

09:49.360 --> 09:50.110
<b>Let me ask.</b>

09:50.740 --> 09:51.530
<b>Huh?</b>

09:51.530 --> 09:53.360
<b>Oh, y-y-yes!</b>

09:53.360 --> 09:57.490
<b>Are you also one of the Mages
seeking the Holy Grail?</b>

09:57.490 --> 09:58.490
<b>Huh?</b>

10:00.580 --> 10:04.330
<b>At first, I thought I wanted it
because it seemed awesome.</b>

10:04.710 --> 10:05.460
<b>But now...</b>

10:05.690 --> 10:07.840
<b>my Servant is in trouble...</b>

10:08.460 --> 10:11.590
<b>so I'd like to resolve that
with the Holy Grail first.</b>

10:12.590 --> 10:13.590
<b>One question.</b>

10:14.470 --> 10:17.600
<b>How are you going to open
the path out of here?</b>

10:18.180 --> 10:21.930
<b>By killing the Master
who created this realm?</b>

10:21.930 --> 10:26.150
<b><i>We just settled on avoiding conflict
as much as possible.</i></b>

10:26.940 --> 10:28.190
<b>Who is that?</b>

10:28.730 --> 10:32.360
<b><i>Someone like a guardian
for that young man over there.</i></b>

10:32.360 --> 10:37.530
<b><i>Though it's probably asking for too much
to believe me as I'm not on the scene.</i></b>

10:37.530 --> 10:42.870
<b><i>If you want to leave this realm
even if it means killing a young child...</i></b>

10:42.870 --> 10:45.960
<b><i>I'd like to propose
that there are other ways to go about it.</i></b>

10:46.920 --> 10:48.500
<b>I will at least listen.</b>

10:49.630 --> 10:51.460
<b>That won't work, Miss.</b>

10:52.710 --> 10:54.550
<b>Such a path...</b>

10:54.780 --> 10:58.340
<b>doesn't exist in this world...</b>

10:58.340 --> 11:00.930
<b>that Tsubaki created, okay?</b>

11:02.140 --> 11:04.640
<b>How did you get such a Servant?</b>

11:05.270 --> 11:08.850
<b>More importantly, why did you give
Command Spells to a comatose Tsubaki?</b>

11:09.650 --> 11:11.440
<b>I found...</b>

11:12.280 --> 11:13.780
<b>a guidepost.</b>

11:14.490 --> 11:18.700
<b>Do you know how many bacteria
a human body hosts?</b>

11:18.700 --> 11:19.320
<b>Huh?</b>

11:20.410 --> 11:22.200
<b>Several hundred trillion.</b>

11:22.200 --> 11:23.450
<b>Among them...</b>

11:23.870 --> 11:28.080
<b>there's one that forcefully awakens
the Magic Circuits within the host human.</b>

11:28.790 --> 11:31.590
<b>And to make its habitation
more comfortable...</b>

11:31.590 --> 11:33.800
<b>it starts operating...</b>

11:33.800 --> 11:35.970
<b>in the most efficient way possible.</b>

11:36.550 --> 11:39.210
<b>You can't win with a straightforward
approach against them...</b>

11:39.210 --> 11:40.390
<b>against the Makiri Family!</b>

11:40.620 --> 11:43.970
<b>What I sought after
was something to surpass them.</b>

11:43.970 --> 11:46.140
<b>A symbiotic relationship with Magecraft
which must be harnessed!</b>

11:49.560 --> 11:51.230
<b><i>You're a good girl, Tsubaki.</i></b>

11:51.770 --> 11:54.980
<b><i>You're a good girl,
so you can endure this, right?</i></b>

11:55.690 --> 11:58.030
<b>You put bacteria inside
your daughter's body?</b>

11:58.650 --> 12:02.740
<b>I trembled when I harvested it
in those Latin American ruins!</b>

12:03.120 --> 12:04.700
<b>With astounding values...</b>

12:04.700 --> 12:07.540
<b>that bacteria adapts to humanity
through Magecraft.</b>

12:08.250 --> 12:11.330
<b>It was a miscalculation
that it encroached up to the brain.</b>

12:11.830 --> 12:13.590
<b>Oh, Tsubaki...</b>

12:14.050 --> 12:15.340
<b>our dream!</b>

12:16.260 --> 12:17.800
<b>Our precious...</b>

12:18.170 --> 12:19.550
<b>child!</b>

12:20.050 --> 12:22.050
<b>If I keep Tsubaki alive...</b>

12:22.280 --> 12:26.140
<b>in due time this warped dream
will engulf the real world.</b>

12:26.680 --> 12:28.480
<b>So, you have to kill her...</b>

12:29.270 --> 12:31.980
<b>that pitiful child.</b>

12:43.280 --> 12:44.410
<b>Hey.</b>

12:45.080 --> 12:46.990
<b>You found me.</b>

12:47.370 --> 12:49.790
<b>Here, I'll give you some candy syrup.</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:54.040
<b>Um...</b>

12:54.670 --> 12:56.210
<b>Are you an important person?</b>

12:56.550 --> 12:58.010
<b>A close call.</b>

12:58.010 --> 13:00.760
<b>My importance is a thing of the past.</b>

13:00.760 --> 13:02.130
<b>I'm not even a person.</b>

13:06.560 --> 13:07.970
<b>Oh, drats.</b>

13:08.350 --> 13:10.080
<b>This is a bad habit of mine.</b>

13:10.080 --> 13:11.780
<b>After all, it's been two thousand</b>

13:11.780 --> 13:14.060
<b>and several hundred years
since I last talked to a human.</b>

13:16.480 --> 13:18.530
<b>Are you all right?</b>

13:19.150 --> 13:20.860
<b>You are a kind one.</b>

13:21.280 --> 13:25.830
<b>I just want to know why
I have arrived here.</b>

13:26.370 --> 13:28.540
<b>And to do that, I have a favor to ask you—</b>

13:28.540 --> 13:30.290
<b>So, this is where you were.</b>

13:31.910 --> 13:32.870
<b>Who are you?</b>

13:35.590 --> 13:38.550
<b>You are not entrapped within this realm.</b>

13:39.010 --> 13:40.760
<b>Let me confirm something.</b>

13:41.550 --> 13:45.430
<b>Are you an enemy of this girl? Or an ally?</b>

13:45.850 --> 13:47.970
<b>As of now, I intend to protect her.</b>

13:48.310 --> 13:49.890
<b>Oh, wonderful!</b>

13:50.270 --> 13:52.840
<b>I was a bit uneasy since
your eyes looked more</b>

13:52.840 --> 13:55.730
<b>like someone who'd kill
their rulers, if anything.</b>

13:55.730 --> 13:57.320
<b>But if that's the case, I am relieved.</b>

13:57.770 --> 14:01.070
<b>Please, call me "Jiao."</b>

14:01.990 --> 14:05.530
<b>Rest assured, I am her ally, as well.</b>

14:06.620 --> 14:07.990
<b>I'll hear you out.</b>

14:08.370 --> 14:09.490
<b>Oh...</b>

14:09.490 --> 14:11.330
<b>I am so glad you are intelligent.</b>

14:11.750 --> 14:13.120
<b>But how unfortunate.</b>

14:13.460 --> 14:15.710
<b>I will sink down again soon.</b>

14:17.250 --> 14:19.170
<b>Monsters are headed this way.</b>

14:19.170 --> 14:22.130
<b>The incarnation of malady
will closely observe her, as well.</b>

14:22.130 --> 14:24.090
<b>I can't hide all of my existence, either.</b>

14:25.220 --> 14:26.300
<b>What's wrong?</b>

14:26.640 --> 14:28.050
<b>It's fine.</b>

14:28.050 --> 14:31.100
<b>I'm just going to play
a bit of hide-and-seek again.</b>

14:42.030 --> 14:47.700
<b>Take that. Have yourself or someone
who is always with Tsubaki hold onto it.</b>

14:47.930 --> 14:51.660
<b>It is something that was once called
"the God-Felling Crossbow."</b>

14:52.080 --> 14:54.000
<b>What in the world are you?</b>

14:54.330 --> 14:55.790
<b>Are you a Servant?</b>

14:56.120 --> 14:59.500
<b>It's a long story to tell,
but if I'm going to keep it simple—</b>

15:00.500 --> 15:01.210
<b>Wait.</b>

15:01.630 --> 15:04.490
<b>Why do I feel the
presence of that giant beast</b>

15:04.490 --> 15:06.380
<b>that covers the sky from you?</b>

15:07.390 --> 15:08.680
<b>You know about Watcher?</b>

15:08.910 --> 15:11.180
<b>Oh no, I'm at my limit.</b>

15:11.180 --> 15:14.750
<b>You should show that crossbow
to a clearheaded Mage!</b>

15:14.750 --> 15:15.850
<b>That way...</b>

15:16.190 --> 15:18.100
<b>Right! I entrust it to you!</b>

15:18.300 --> 15:20.060
<b>Protecting Tsubaki...</b>

15:23.030 --> 15:25.800
<b>You've decided to reveal
your hand this time around.</b>

15:25.800 --> 15:27.530
<b>Quite the composure you have...</b>

15:27.530 --> 15:28.450
<b>vampire.</b>

15:28.950 --> 15:30.410
<b>This child is...</b>

15:30.410 --> 15:35.500
<b>He can change form or soul,
but he can't change that warped smile.</b>

15:35.870 --> 15:40.750
<b>I didn't think the same trick
would work twice against you, Executor.</b>

15:40.750 --> 15:42.570
<b>That, and I eventually wanted to see</b>

15:42.570 --> 15:44.920
<b>all sorts of expressions
from that pretty lady!</b>

15:45.340 --> 15:46.130
<b>Right?</b>

15:51.180 --> 15:52.970
<b>You're so cute, Assassin!</b>

15:53.850 --> 15:56.390
<b>Did you think that
I'd be stupidly honest...</b>

15:56.390 --> 15:59.900
<b>and show up in my actual form
before you, an enemy?</b>

16:00.310 --> 16:01.230
<b>Huh?</b>

16:01.650 --> 16:04.820
<b>Tsubaki, who is that guy there?</b>

16:04.820 --> 16:06.400
<b>Oh, Jester!</b>

16:06.630 --> 16:08.910
<b>Oh, this is amazing!</b>

16:08.910 --> 16:11.410
<b>This looks like a secret hideout!</b>

16:12.240 --> 16:13.910
<b>You're lucky.</b>

16:14.290 --> 16:17.580
<b>I can't kill you in front of Tsubaki.</b>

16:18.000 --> 16:19.870
<b>Don't get the wrong idea, okay?</b>

16:19.870 --> 16:22.790
<b>I'm Tsubaki's friend, you see.</b>

16:24.210 --> 16:25.590
<b>Hey, Tsubaki!</b>

16:25.590 --> 16:26.760
<b>What is it?</b>

16:27.090 --> 16:29.130
<b>I heard from my dad...</b>

16:29.130 --> 16:33.470
<b>that your dad and mom
are really important Mages.</b>

16:33.890 --> 16:34.890
<b>Yep!</b>

16:34.890 --> 16:38.390
<b>Daddy and Mommy are both amazing Mages!</b>

16:38.770 --> 16:43.650
<b>And you said you wanted to be helpful
for your dad and mom, right?</b>

16:44.110 --> 16:45.190
<b>Yep!</b>

16:45.570 --> 16:48.780
<b>I wonder. What should we do
to make them the happiest?</b>

16:48.980 --> 16:52.990
<b>What are your parents wishing for?</b>

16:53.190 --> 16:54.030
<b>Stop it!</b>

16:54.030 --> 16:54.990
<b>You know...</b>

16:55.370 --> 16:56.080
<b>I...</b>

16:56.700 --> 16:57.750
<b>I want...</b>

16:58.290 --> 17:00.120
<b>to become a Magician...</b>

17:01.000 --> 17:02.710
<b>for Daddy and Mommy!</b>

17:02.910 --> 17:04.790
<b>I want to become a Magician!</b>

17:09.720 --> 17:11.550
<b>Wh-What is this?</b>

17:11.970 --> 17:14.390
<b>This is the path to death.</b>

17:14.390 --> 17:16.100
<b>The underworld.</b>

17:16.100 --> 17:17.350
<b>The passageway to Hades.</b>

17:18.180 --> 17:19.140
<b>You are judgment.</b>

17:19.850 --> 17:21.060
<b>You are gospel.</b>

17:21.730 --> 17:24.770
<b>An eternal tranquility.</b>

17:25.190 --> 17:26.270
<b><i>Flat!</i></b>

17:26.270 --> 17:27.980
<b><i>Tell me what is going on!</i></b>

17:28.440 --> 17:29.570
<b>Professor...</b>

17:29.570 --> 17:30.740
<b>the world...</b>

17:30.740 --> 17:31.950
<b>is turning black!</b>

17:32.740 --> 17:35.620
<b>The passageway to Hades
will become my minion...</b>

17:35.950 --> 17:37.910
<b>and protect my lord.</b>

17:38.410 --> 17:39.910
<b>The Holy Grail.</b>

17:42.000 --> 17:43.500
<b>To my lord.</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:45.590
<b>To the hands of my friend.</b>

17:45.590 --> 17:46.920
<b>The Holy Grail!</b>

17:47.630 --> 17:48.840
<b>It can't be!</b>

17:48.840 --> 17:50.760
<b>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse!</b>

17:50.760 --> 17:52.090
<b>The embodiment of death...</b>

17:52.090 --> 17:53.590
<b>Pale Rider?</b>

17:53.820 --> 17:56.680
<b>You bastard! What did you do
to that young girl?</b>

17:57.010 --> 18:00.730
<b>I merely gave her a supportive push.</b>

18:01.140 --> 18:07.570
<b>So that a child can be a child
and chase after a grand dream.</b>

18:23.000 --> 18:24.080
<b><i>Ex...</i></b>

18:24.080 --> 18:25.130
<b><i>calib—</i></b>

18:27.340 --> 18:28.840
<b>Saber!</b>

18:29.710 --> 18:32.210
<b>You didn't fully heal your wounds!</b>

18:45.190 --> 18:45.810
<b>Go!</b>

18:47.650 --> 18:48.560
<b>Thank you!</b>

18:58.030 --> 18:59.700
<b><i>Why someone like me?</i></b>

18:59.930 --> 19:00.830
<b><i>No!</i></b>

19:01.290 --> 19:03.580
<b><i>There's nothing that I can do!</i></b>

19:03.580 --> 19:05.460
<b><i>No! No! No!</i></b>

19:05.960 --> 19:07.960
<b><i>I'm not a Master at all!</i></b>

19:08.790 --> 19:10.290
<b><i>I didn't become one.</i></b>

19:10.290 --> 19:11.300
<b><i>I ran away again.</i></b>

19:12.300 --> 19:13.920
<b><i>Because it was easier to run away!</i></b>

19:14.470 --> 19:16.300
<b><i>I don't have anywhere to go to anymore!</i></b>

19:17.340 --> 19:18.140
<b>Move aside.</b>

19:19.680 --> 19:21.350
<b>You can kill me.</b>

19:21.810 --> 19:22.850
<b>You can curse me.</b>

19:23.720 --> 19:25.980
<b>I'm sure you have the right to do so.</b>

19:26.440 --> 19:28.310
<b>I am afraid of you...</b>

19:28.310 --> 19:28.940
<b>but...</b>

19:29.770 --> 19:33.530
<b>Right now, I'm more scared
of running away from Saber!</b>

19:37.740 --> 19:38.490
<b>Huh?</b>

19:46.250 --> 19:48.080
<b>Oh, Ayaka.</b>

19:48.460 --> 19:50.590
<b>You always manage to surprise me.</b>

19:52.630 --> 19:53.630
<b>Saber!</b>

19:54.130 --> 19:55.970
<b>Don't give me that look.</b>

19:56.300 --> 19:57.720
<b>These wounds are trivial.</b>

19:57.720 --> 20:00.300
<b>We've gone over this many times already.</b>

20:00.300 --> 20:03.130
<b>But I've made up my mind,
so just shut up and listen!</b>

20:03.130 --> 20:04.390
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

20:05.100 --> 20:08.600
<b>Saber, you're still holding back
some of your power, aren't you?</b>

20:10.980 --> 20:15.360
<b>I will no longer run away from you
or from the Holy Grail War!</b>

20:15.360 --> 20:17.820
<b>I decided that I will fight
together with you!</b>

20:18.020 --> 20:20.780
<b>Though, I just decided that right now,
and I'm sorry about that!</b>

20:20.780 --> 20:22.370
<b>Oh, right. Okay.</b>

20:24.120 --> 20:27.750
<b>If I die because my Magical Energy
is sucked dry, that's fine!</b>

20:28.100 --> 20:29.790
<b>No, it's not fine,</b>

20:29.790 --> 20:32.630
<b>but it's a whole lot better
than dying in a place like this!</b>

20:32.630 --> 20:36.090
<b>So, I'm going to do
what I am capable of doing!</b>

20:36.510 --> 20:37.880
<b>I will fight, too!</b>

20:38.470 --> 20:40.640
<b>Please teach me how to fight!</b>

20:41.050 --> 20:43.300
<b>I don't care if it's
just how to throw a rock.</b>

20:43.680 --> 20:45.600
<b>If you think
I'd just drag you down...</b>

20:45.600 --> 20:48.600
<b>it can be something like
amplifying my Magical Energy!</b>

20:49.980 --> 20:52.190
<b>I'm glad you feel that way...</b>

20:52.190 --> 20:53.730
<b>and you are strong.</b>

20:53.730 --> 20:54.800
<b>But...</b>

20:54.800 --> 20:57.740
<b>I, in my current state,
can't answer your call.</b>

20:58.150 --> 20:59.280
<b>Huh?</b>

20:59.280 --> 21:01.570
<b>I really learned a lesson
from that golden guy.</b>

21:02.450 --> 21:05.450
<b>I still haven't found a reason
to risk my life or chivalry.</b>

21:05.450 --> 21:10.410
<b>Nor trample upon other people's wishes
to obtain the Holy Grail.</b>

21:10.790 --> 21:12.120
<b>Saber...</b>

21:12.120 --> 21:15.130
<b>That's why I don't mind fading away.</b>

21:15.130 --> 21:17.630
<b>I brought you into this, so
keeping you alive is first and foremost!</b>

21:18.170 --> 21:19.840
<b>The wish can be anything!</b>

21:20.220 --> 21:23.470
<b>I don't care if you want to sell
the Holy Grail and make money off of it!</b>

21:23.470 --> 21:25.250
<b>You know, you said you were going to</b>

21:25.250 --> 21:28.140
<b>take music back to the Throne
or Heaven or wherever it was!</b>

21:30.100 --> 21:33.650
<b>Throne aside, my place isn't in Heaven.</b>

21:49.040 --> 21:50.200
<b>Cookies?</b>

21:50.430 --> 21:55.130
<b>Incorporating Cerberus was interesting,
but that was a mistake!</b>

21:55.540 --> 21:58.670
<b>Its weakness is so famous, as you can see!</b>

22:01.090 --> 22:03.380
<b>Oh, I guess it's nice to meet you!</b>

22:03.610 --> 22:05.890
<b>King Lionheart...</b>

22:05.890 --> 22:07.470
<b>and I don't really get it...</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:09.970
<b>but the girl with amazing Magical Energy!</b>

22:07.470 --> 22:09.970
<b>EPISODE 12</b>
